### Voice Agent Chat API Test Requests
### Use this file with VS Code REST Client extension or similar tools

### 1. Test Root Endpoint
GET http://localhost:8000/

### 2. Send a Chat Message (Main endpoint)
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "data": "Hello! Can you help me with travel information?",
  "user_id": "test-user-123",
  "user_name": "Test User"
}

### 3. Send Another Message (Same User - Should Use Same Session)
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "data": "Can you remember our previous conversation?",
  "user_id": "test-user-123",
  "user_name": "Test User"
}

### 4. Test Travel Hands Query
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "data": "What is the active journey for user 123?",
  "user_id": "test-user-123",
  "user_name": "Test User"
}

### 5. Get Conversation History
GET http://localhost:8000/chat-history/test-user-123?limit=10

### 6. Test Different User
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "data": "Hello from a different user!",
  "user_id": "test-user-456",
  "user_name": "Another Test User"
}

### 7. Delete User Chat History
DELETE http://localhost:8000/chat-history/test-user-123
